    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve</p><p>You strike a creature in its very soul.</p><p>When you deal <strong>Damage</strong> to a living or spiritual creature with an attack from Mystwalker, you may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> to make a <strong>4:1 Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check opposed by the target's <strong>Willpower</strong>. If the target is a spirit, demon, or sacred beast, it has <strong>Disadvantage</strong> on this check.</p><p>If you succeed the target takes additional <strong>Damage</strong> equal to the difference in successes. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p>",
